                [
                    108.0,
                    646.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The names of the arbitrators will be kept on individual slips of paper. The Company and the Union will randomly and blindly select seven (7) names. They will then alternately strike names from this selection of seven (7) arbitrators until one (1) name remains. That individual will be the Arbitrator. The party striking the first name will be the loser of a coin toss. All names will be returned to the panel of names to be used in the next selection process.",
